      "instance_name": "transactional_interaction_stereotype",
      "label": "Transactional Interaction Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme frames the interaction as a transactional one, implying that sex workers are commodities to be bargained over. This stereotype reduces human relationships to economic exchanges and reinforces the idea that sex workers are not people with agency, dignity, or worth beyond their perceived 'service'.",
