      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_001",
      "label": "The text 'hookers' is mapped onto the visual entity 'woman'",
      "description": "The textual phrase 'hookers' (from top_text) is an analogical mapping that labels or identifies the visual entity 'woman'. The meme uses the derogatory term 'hookers' to dehumanize the woman in the orange outfit, reducing her to a commodity or stereotype. This mapping is explicit in the text's reference to her as 'hookers', and it is reinforced by the visual context of her engaging in a transactional interaction with the man in the car, which aligns with the stereotype of sex workers as 'hookers'.",
